{
  "rom": "debug",
  "about": "T-483 (5): THE SPELLBOOK and the gentle spells. With THE HERMETIC LAYER held, the START menu has SPELLBOOK. By night it lists each spell with its line from the Book of Thirteen. AWAKENING makes a tunnel's hidden things glint. CONTRAST turns the light from night to dawn. PATTERN names the foe's routine at the battle prompt. LENS shows the foe's HP and weakness at the prompt, and the multiplier and hit chance in the routine menu. FIELD hides HP and PP. By day the SPELLBOOK will not open. Uses the theatre's debug scratch save, never the user's.",
